thetic Enzymes Found in Diverse Organisms</article-title><source>Journal of Molecular Evolution</source><year>1998</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>401</fpage><lpage>408</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9541534</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/PL00006319</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Miyazaki</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kobashi</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujii</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Nishiyama</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamane</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization of a lysK gene as an argE homolog in Thermus thermophilus HB27</article-title><source>FEBS Lett</source><year>2002</year><volume>512</volume><fpage>269</fpage><lpage>274</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11852094</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0014-5793(02)02290-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hochuli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Patzelt</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Oesterhelt</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>W&#x000fc;thrich</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Szyperski</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Amino Acid Biosynthesis in the Halophilic Archaeon <italic>Haloarcula hispanica</italic></article-title><source>Journal of Bacteriology</source><year>1999</year><volume>181</volume><fpage>3226</fpage><lpage>3237</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10322026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bakhiet</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Forney</surname><gi